0","synopsis":"Arson Theft Control struggled to investigate Gohei Ishikawa, a member of a notorious clan led by Shinbei the Viper. As a child, he was abused by his step-father. While Heizo was in Kyoto, the abuse escalated and led to him stabbing his step-father to death. He ran away from Edo and resented Onihei for the incident.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4Tdzf2DBnef67C95pcvINOPGdMu.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 8","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"12369","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"97590","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"33983","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"70943","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"319999","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"75051","synopsis":"Heizo realized his pipe, a valuable keep-sake of his father, was gone. After patrolling the city, he stepped into a boat where Tomogoro, the boatman was smoking with the very pipe that was stolen. Tomogoro proudly revealed how he stole Heizo's pipe to frustrate the feared \"Onihei\" of Edo.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5CEt6in5V8sEKcaKksJ6nuPI7vj.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 9","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"12369","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"97590","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"33983","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"70943","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"319999","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"75052","synopsis":"Back in the day when young Heizo used to call himself Tetsusaburo, a skilled man named Jyubei Matsuoka entered the Takasugi Dojo during his lessons. Later, Heizo returns home where his father's legal wife, Hatsu, calls him an illegitimate child. Dispirited, Heizo accepts an assignment to rob with his best friend, Samanosuke.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fNkKlaHIC9MHwJkFT0r1Qnuwqzz.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 10","episodeNumber":10,"sourceEpisodeNumber":10,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"12369","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"97590","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"mal","id":"33983","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"70943","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"319999","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]}],"link":"75053","synopsis":"Wasuke of Dojo returns to Asakusa and reunites with Magokichi. His son Isotaro was Wasuke's biological child. But Isotaro took his own life after his boss at Ozuya framed him for a crime. Both Magokichi and his wife Ohiro committed suicide by throwing themselves in the water. To avenge them, Wasuke decides to rob Ozuya...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/n8KH7UPGXlqTRZfLCiMHRZNIHpy.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 11","episodeNumber":11,"sourceEpisodeNumber":11,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"12369","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"97590","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"mal","id":"33983","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"70943","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"319999","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]}],"link":"75054","synopsis":"While Heizo was out, Hisae received a letter which read, \"Tomorrow at four, at tea shop Yoshinoya by the Gokokuji gates...\" The sender was the man of the past, Kanshiro Kondo. Hisae goes to the place alone. Kanshiro tells her, \"don't be surprised when you get back.\"","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2BP2MfYpMZfckWZETJLjBmQidDc.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 12","episodeNumber":12,"sourceEpisodeNumber":12,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappi